{"level":30,"time":1778188309710,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24GHSZAR9RF97CW51H5NGZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, now I have the grouping file. Let me understand what I'm reviewing:\n\n**Grouping 2: Tree Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines**\n\nKey requirements:\n- UCM § 1.10.10.4 governs tree placement near overhead electric facilities\n- Distribution lines (< 60kV): \n  - Utility-compatible trees only within 15 feet\n  - Any trees < 40 ft mature height within 15-25 feet\n  - All trees allowed beyond 25 feet\n- Transmission lines (≥ 60kV):\n  - Utility-compatible trees only within 50 feet\n  - Any trees < 40 ft mature height within 50 feet\n- Additional prohibitions:\n  - 10 feet from poles\n  - 10 feet from pad-mounted equipment\n  - 5 feet from underground equipment\n  - Trees within transmission easements\n\nI have 15 checklist items to evaluate (EL-2.1 through EL-2.15).\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Check the project facts to understand what infrastructure is present\n2. Review the site plan documents to understand the project\n3. Evaluate each checklist item\n\nLet me start by reading the facts and README for this project.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d122776-20ac-46ff-b558-35791e0f03e5","uuid":"33fcece0-f3c9-439c-8ee8-41944c496dd5"}
