{"level":30,"time":1778188314764,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24GPW13E7TYNF2RW0YJ6K6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I can see from the facts.md that there are **5 ft electric easements (×2)** listed as plat-dedicated (Easement 7 & 8) from Travis County Doc 73/76, Case C8S-75-160. This indicates there are overhead electric facilities on or near this site.\n\nNow let me check the site plan sheets to understand what utility infrastructure is present. The key sheets to review for this grouping are:\n- Sheet 9: Site Plan\n- Sheet 21: Preliminary Electrical Design Plan\n- Sheet 31: Landscape Plan\n- Possibly Sheet 11: Grading Plan (for transmission easement boundaries)\n\nLet me start by examining these sheets to understand what utility infrastructure exists and where trees are being proposed.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8e2cb63b-05d8-41aa-bedd-77a52405a611","uuid":"675fd205-e262-4959-8c95-9e573d2e1250"}
