{"level":30,"time":1778188334355,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24H891XVZ11AZM6ZJZNABA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! Now I have the plant schedule. The proposed trees are:\n\n**Shade Trees:**\n- 2 Live Oak (Quercus virginiana) - 100 gal, 4\" caliper, 16' minimum height\n- 10 Cedar Elm (Ulmus crassifolia) - 100 gal, 4\" caliper, 16' minimum height\n\n**Ornamental Trees:**\n- 2 Texas Mountain Laurel (Sophora secundiflora) - 45 gal, 2.5\" caliper, 8' minimum height\n- 6 Mexican Redbud (Cercis canadensis var. mexicana) - 45 gal, 2.5\" caliper, 10' minimum height\n\nNow I need to check:\n1. Whether these are utility-compatible per ECM Appendix F\n2. Their mature heights per ECM Appendix F\n3. Where they are located on the landscape plan relative to overhead electric facilities\n4. The distances from any overhead conductors, poles, or equipment\n\nThe grouping mentions that:\n- Utility-compatible trees are marked with \"x\" in the \"UC\" column of ECM Appendix F\n- Large trees have mature height ≥ 40 feet per ECM Appendix F (for electrical purposes)\n\nFrom the regulatory overview:\n- Non-utility-compatible trees cannot be planted within 15 feet of distribution lines\n- Large trees (≥40 ft) cannot be planted within 25 feet of distribution lines\n- Trees cannot be planted within 10 feet of utility poles\n- Transmission lines require 50 feet minimum and only utility-compatible trees\n\nNow I need to use vision to check:\n1. The landscape plan to see exactly where the trees are positioned\n2. The overhead electric line locations\n3. The measurements/clearances\n\nLet me call a vision check on the landscape plan to see what information is available about tree placements and overhead electric.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df902855-f209-47f1-9270-a32412d9566b","uuid":"fa3ca778-3fd1-4ed1-8e12-0802c67b6c6c"}
