{"level":30,"time":1778188353350,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BgAQVRwn93Cv99KWdMJvGS","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a visual analysis of the provided site plan document, here are the findings regarding the transformer pads:\n\n**Are transformer pads shown on the electrical plan?**\nYes, there are several transformer pads explicitly labeled on the plan. They are identified by callout boxes containing the text exactly as: \"**Electrical Transformer Pad**\".\n\n**Locations relative to the buildings:**\nBased on the drawing layout, five distinct \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" locations are identified by leader lines pointing to rectangular symbols:\n\n1.  **West side of site near entrance:** Located near the curved entry drive on the left side of the drawing, situated roughly northwest of **Bldg. 2**.\n2.  **West of Bldg. 2:** Located on the left side of the drawing, positioned between the western side of **Bldg. 2** and the property line/sidewalk easement.\n3.  **West of Bldg. 8:** Located on the lower left side of the drawing, positioned between the western side of **Bldg. 8** and the property line/sidewalk easement.\n4.  **Between Bldg. 4 & Bldg. 5:** Located in the central part of the site, positioned in the space between the eastern side of **Bldg. 4** and the western side of **Bldg. 5**.\n5.  **Between Bldg. 7 & Bldg. 6:** Located in the central-lower part of the site, positioned in the space between the eastern side of **Bldg. 7** and the western side of **Bldg. 6**.\n\n**Minimum Clearances:**\nThere are **no minimum clearances** (such as dimension lines, clearance boundary boxes, or specific notes indicating required distances) indicated around any of the identified electrical transformer pads on this specific page of the plan. A review of the \"Utility Notes\" section at the bottom right also reveals no mention of transformer clearance requirements."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"adc7a674-5884-4de3-afe6-da189845114c","uuid":"7a4ddd73-2439-405a-ade1-ed37c521a603","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a visual analysis of the provided site plan document, here are the findings regarding the transformer pads:\n\n**Are transformer pads shown on the electrical plan?**\nYes, there are several transformer pads explicitly labeled on the plan. They are identified by callout boxes containing the text exactly as: \"**Electrical Transformer Pad**\".\n\n**Locations relative to the buildings:**\nBased on the drawing layout, five distinct \"Electrical Transformer Pad\" locations are identified by leader lines pointing to rectangular symbols:\n\n1.  **West side of site near entrance:** Located near the curved entry drive on the left side of the drawing, situated roughly northwest of **Bldg. 2**.\n2.  **West of Bldg. 2:** Located on the left side of the drawing, positioned between the western side of **Bldg. 2** and the property line/sidewalk easement.\n3.  **West of Bldg. 8:** Located on the lower left side of the drawing, positioned between the western side of **Bldg. 8** and the property line/sidewalk easement.\n4.  **Between Bldg. 4 & Bldg. 5:** Located in the central part of the site, positioned in the space between the eastern side of **Bldg. 4** and the western side of **Bldg. 5**.\n5.  **Between Bldg. 7 & Bldg. 6:** Located in the central-lower part of the site, positioned in the space between the eastern side of **Bldg. 7** and the western side of **Bldg. 6**.\n\n**Minimum Clearances:**\nThere are **no minimum clearances** (such as dimension lines, clearance boundary boxes, or specific notes indicating required distances) indicated around any of the identified electrical transformer pads on this specific page of the plan. A review of the \"Utility Notes\" section at the bottom right also reveals no mention of transformer clearance requirements."}]}
