 symbol near the bottom left corner of the property boundary (which includes a line labeled \"Guy\" for a guy wire). The `- OHE -` line continues to the right, passing another pole near the bottom right corner within an area labeled \"5' Elec. & Tele. Easement\".\n*   **Conflicts:** The overhead lines run along the outer boundary of the site. The nearest buildings (labeled **Bldg. 8**, **Bldg. 7**, and **Bldg. 6**) are set back from this property line. Based on the building footprints shown, no buildings or major structures appear to conflict with or cross under the `- OHE -` lines. A \"Concrete Retaining Wall\" and \"Concrete Fence\" run near this line, but no structural conflicts with the buildings are evident on this plan."}]}
