{"level":30,"time":1778188362005,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24J5AFYYWCRP2FMXNXNH24","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The grading plan blocks description doesn't mention transformer pads specifically in the detailed content. It mentions various utilities and infrastructure but no specific mention of transformer pad grading or drainage around them.\n\nLet me now check the site plan (Sheet 9) to see if transformer pads are shown there with any clearance information.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"21ef172e-3b37-47d1-a102-ca3d2cea074d","uuid":"dbf98b68-9961-455a-9636-04000454d18e"}
{"level":30,"time":1778188362116,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24J66QNBG3TJS3J6ZV7Y28","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a critical finding! The landscape plan shows:\n1. Overhead electric (OHE) lines running horizontally along the southern boundary\n2. Proposed tree symbols (circles with 'X' or '+' inside) directly along this boundary in very close proximity to the OHE lines\n3. NO visible clearance dimensions or measurements documented\n\nThis suggests potential violations of the clearance requirements. Now I need to:\n1. Determine which specific tree species are being placed near these OHE lines\n2. Get their mature heights and utility compatibility status\n3. Compare against the clearance requirements\n\nLet me examine the landscape plan more closely to identify exactly which trees are positioned along the OHE line, and then cross-reference their species with the plant schedule.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8e2cb63b-05d8-41aa-bedd-77a52405a611","uuid":"71aa5d03-eeff-4198-b043-1ddd178c88dc"}
