ndary (left side of the plan, near the main road frontage).\n*   Another runs horizontally along the southern edge of the property boundary (bottom side of the plan).\n\n**Are proposed buildings, parking areas, driveways, or other site features shown in relation to the overhead electric lines with clearance dimensions labeled?**\nWhile the proposed buildings (e.g., Buildings 1, 7, and 8), driveways, and site features are shown visually in relation to the \"- OHE -\" lines, **there are no clearance dimensions explicitly labeled** between the overhead electric lines and these proposed site features. \n\nThere are standard setback or distance dimensions shown from the buildings to the property lines (e.g., \"37.6'\" near Building 1 and \"28.0'\" near Building 8 on the western boundary), but none are specifically dimensioned to the overhead electric lines or labeled as clearance requirements for those lines."}]}
