ne. Based on the scale provided in the bottom right corner (SCALE IN FEET (1\"=20'-0\")), these trees appear to be well within the 10-50 foot range of the overhead lines.\n\n**Are their species identified?**\n**No**, specific tree species are not identified on this page. The trees along this bottom edge are only labeled with functional tags, specifically **\"M\"**. According to the Key Notes on the right side of the page, **\"M - MITIGATION TREE\"**. There is no plant schedule or detailed species list provided on this specific sheet to indicate exactly what type of trees they will be."}]}
