king spaces located in front of Building 1 and Building 8.\n\nThe specific text label is: **\"Transformer Pad (Typ.)\"** with a leader line pointing to a rectangular box.\n\n**Labeled clearances or measurements:**\nThere are **no** labeled clearances, setback distances, or specific measurements shown on this sheet radiating from the transformer pad to adjacent buildings, parking areas, sidewalks, or property lines. While the physical footprint is drawn, no numerical distances relative to other site features are provided in the immediate vicinity of this label."}]}
