rical Transformer Pad\" locations relative to the buildings or structures. \n\nThe 5 identified pads are located at:\n*   West of Building 1 (near Unit 101)\n*   West of Building 2 (near Unit 201)\n*   West of Building 8 (near Unit 801)\n*   East side, between Building 4 and Building 5\n*   East side, near Building 7 / Building 6\n\n**2. Are any pads closer than 10 feet to buildings?**\nWhile exact measurements are not written, **yes, visually they appear to be closer than 10 feet.** \n\nUsing the provided graphic scale of **1\" = 20'** (top right) as a visual reference, the drawn gap between the rectangular transformer pad symbols and the adjacent building footprint lines is extremely small. For pads like those next to Building 1, Building 2, and Building 8, the clearance gap appears to be roughly equivalent to or smaller than the width of the transformer pad itself. Relative to the 20-foot scale marker, these distances visually estimate to be well under 10 feet (likely in the 3 to 5-foot range)."}]}
