unning along the western boundary (within or adjacent to the Valley View Road Right-of-Way) and along the southern boundary of the site.\n*   **Clearance Distances or Elevations:** There are **no specific clearance distances** (e.g., horizontal or vertical minimums) or **conductor/pole elevations** provided directly on this plan view sheet for those overhead lines.\n*   **Reference to Additional Information:** Notably, on the middle-left side of the sheet near the western boundary's overhead line, there is a specific callout text that reads exactly: **\"See Sht. 19 for Profile\"**. This indicates that vertical elevation and potentially clearance information related to that area is provided on a separate profile sheet (Sheet 19) rather than on this top-down plan view."}]}
