t) corner of the site plan. They are situated in the narrow landscape strip between the edge of the parking area/building structure and the southern property boundary line where the OHE is routed.\n*   **Distance Estimate:** Using the graphic scale provided in the bottom right corner (\"SCALE IN FEET (1\"=20'-0\")\"), the centers of these three tree symbols appear to be approximately **5 to 10 feet** from the OHE line.\n*   **Labels/Identification:** Yes, these specific trees are identified. Two of the three tree symbols in this specific cluster have a clear label \"**M**\" placed immediately next to them. According to the text key located beneath the \"KEY NOTES\" section on the right side of the plan, \"**M - MITIGATION TREE**\"."}]}
