{"level":30,"time":1778188510116,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24PKT0Z27N42H2Z9W78J9D","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is very important information. The site clearly has transmission easements with specific requirements. From the notes:\n- Transmission structures on or near the site\n- 25-foot clearance required for digging/grading\n- 20-foot clearance from overhead transmission lines for construction equipment\n- Pre-construction meeting required with Austin Energy 48 hours before work\n- No structures permitted within transmission easement except roads/driveways built to specific load standards\n\nNow I need to understand whether the proposed buildings, parking areas, and other site features comply with these clearance requirements. Let me check if there's any documentation showing how the project layout relates to these transmission easements.\n\nThe key questions are:\n1. Are there transmission easements shown on the site plan?\n2. Do the buildings and driveways comply with the clearances?\n3. Are there documented elevations and clearance dimensions for overhead lines?\n\nLet me do a vision check on the site plan to see if transmission easements are shown and what the building/driveway relationships are to those easements.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7510649-3f32-4a6d-b604-08af9177b220","uuid":"a4886c32-6aec-490f-80d4-8bb756a3f080"}
