{"level":30,"time":1778188533910,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24Q5FXC0WMB2FTHH57FK16","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed a comprehensive site plan review of grouping 13 (Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements) for the Valley View Townhomes project. Here's my summary:\n\n## Review Summary\n\n**Transformer Pads Identified:**\n- 5 transformer pads shown on Electrical Plan (Sheet 21)\n- At least 1 labeled on Site Plan (Sheet 9) as \"Transformer Pad (Typ.)\"\n\n**Critical Finding - Systematic Documentation Gap:**\nThe plans show transformer pad *locations* in plan view but provide virtually *no clearance dimensions, specifications, or detail documentation* required by UCM § 1.10.4 and related standards.\n\n### Key Deficiencies:\n\n**FAIL Items (3):**\n1. **EL-13.31** - No cross-section drawings showing vertical clearances through overhead structures\n2. **EL-13.35** - No transformer easements shown around any pads\n3. **EL-13.37** - No AE Design-approved transformer pad detail sheets with dimensions or service type specifications\n\n**NOT-VERIFIABLE Items (33):**\nDue to missing documentation:\n- No clearance distances labeled (5', 10', 15', 20' etc.)\n- No transformer equipment type specified (oil-filled vs. dry-type)\n- No service type documented (single-phase vs. three-phase)\n- No clearances to buildings, utilities, trees, sidewalks, parking, fire lanes, etc.\n- No documentation of property location compliance or easement avoidance\n- No grading/drainage direction around oil-filled equipment\n- No electrical routing documentation (transformer to meter)\n- No bollard specifications despite proximity to parking\n\n**N/A Items (2):**\n- EL-13.29, EL-13.30 - Niche service not proposed (standard exterior pads only)\n\nThe structured findings have been returned above with full details on each item, including applicable areas, sheet references, and specific comments explaining what documentation is missing."}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"21ef172e-3b37-47d1-a102-ca3d2cea074d","uuid":"4bcf4a7b-159c-426b-a365-2dac63d274c4"}
