re is an overhead utility line indicated by the label **\"- - - OHE - - -\"** running horizontally along the bottom boundary of the site plan. There are proposed trees, specifically tagged with the letter **\"M\"** (identified in the Key Notes as \"M - MITIGATION TREE\"), located in very close proximity to this line, particularly near the bottom right and bottom center areas. Based on the provided scale (1\" = 20'), it appears these trees are planted within 10 to 50 lateral feet of the OHE line.\n\n*   **Are their species identified and can they be verified against the Utility Compatible list in ECM Appendix F?**\n    **No.** This specific sheet does not contain a plant schedule or any labels that identify the exact botanical or common species of the proposed trees. Because the species are not identified on this page, they cannot be verified against the Utility Compatible list in ECM Appendix F using this document alone. A separate sheet containing the plant schedule would be required for verification."}]}
