property boundary (labeled \"S63°03'28\\\"E 419.96'\"), there is a utility pole symbol depicted inside the property line. It is situated within an area delineated by a dashed line and labeled exactly as **\"15' ELEC. EASEMENT VOL. 84, PG. 13 P.R.T.C.TX\"**.\n    *   **Eastern Boundary:** The overhead utility line continues east across the site and crosses the eastern property boundary (labeled \"S27°19'28\\\"W 146.15'\"). It connects to another utility pole that is located just outside the property line to the east."}]}
