Landscape plan (Sheet 31) shows mitigation trees but does not identify species; only Sheet 35 plant list identifies proposed species, which includes non-utility-compatible species (Live Oak) adjacent to OHE\n\n**Positive Finding:**\n- 48-hour notification requirement to Austin Energy IS present on Sheet 3\n\n---\n\nNow I'll prepare structured findings:"}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"542f56f3-727d-4ed6-b349-d11f7598fb66","uuid":"3153a690-312d-4cf6-abc4-16e6a65e360b"}
