es. The 10-foot clearance from pad-mount equipment centerline cannot be verified without dimensional analysis relating the two sheets.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical plan shows transformer pads at multiple locations (e.g., near Buildings 1-8). Landscape plan shows trees throughout the site. No dimensions or cross-reference callouts relate specific trees to specific pad-mount locations or access doors.","reasoning":"Pad-mounted equipment is present (shown on electrical plan), triggering the requirement. However, the spatial relationship between specific pads and nearby trees is not documented on either plan. Cannot verify 10-foot clearances without dimensional analysis.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-2.8","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["site-wide near utility infrastructure"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Underground electric equipment (pull boxes, utility lines) are indicated on the site plan and electrical design plan. Tree locations are shown on the landscape plan. However, no dimensional analysis or cross-reference is provided relating underground equipment locations to specific tree planting locations. The 5-foot clearance from underground equipment cannot be verified without dimensional documentation showing the relationship between proposed trees and underground utility vault/equipment locations.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows underground utility lines and pull boxes. Landscape plan shows trees throughout. No dimensions or analysis links specific tree locations to specific underground equipment.","reasoning":"Underground equipment is present (shown on utility plans), triggering the requirement. However, the specific distances from trees to underg