{"level":30,"time":1778188664794,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24V4XD47SWX7KFB2VJPR5B","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed the site plan review for grouping **EL-2 (Tree Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines)**. \n\n## Review Summary\n\n**Grouping Applicability:** APPLICABLE\n- The project proposes overhead electric (OHE) distribution infrastructure with 5-foot electric utility easements along the southern property boundary\n- Trees are proposed throughout the landscape plan, including within and adjacent to utility easement areas\n- No transmission facilities are present on site\n\n**Key Findings:**\n\n### **FAIL (2 items):**\n\n1. **EL-2.10** - Plant legend incompleteness: The landscape plan identifies trees only by functional category (M = mitigation tree, SY = street yard tree, etc.), not by species. Specific tree species are documented on a separate sheet (Sheet 35), requiring cross-reference. Trees near utility facilities cannot be species-identified from the landscape plan alone.\n\n2. **EL-2.15** - Missing Austin Energy approval: Trees are shown at 5-15 feet from the OHE distribution line within a 5-foot electric utility easement area. No documented written approval from Austin Energy is provided for tree plantings in this utility corridor, which is required for any trees in prohibited clearance zones per UCM § 1.10.10.4.\n\n### **NOT-VERIFIABLE (6 items):**\n\n- **EL-2.1, EL-2.3** - Cannot verify species utility-compatibility (UC status) or mature heights against ECM Appendix F thresholds\n- **EL-2.6, EL-2.7, EL-2.8** - Specific utility infrastructure (poles, pad-mounts, underground equipment) locations not dimensionally related to tree planting locations\n- **EL-2.9** - Root barrier applicability and specifications cannot be verified\n\n### **N/A (5 items):**\n\n- **EL-2.2, EL-2.4, EL-2.5** - No transmission facilities or transmission easements (distribution-only site)\n- **EL-2.12, EL-2.13** - No clearance dimensions shown on plans\n\n### **PASS (1 item):**\n\n- **EL-2.14** - Trees and OHE infrastructure are both clearly shown on the landscape plan with visible spatial relationship\n\nThe structured output above contains detailed findings with evidence, code citations, and applicableشاreas for each checklist item."}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df902855-f209-47f1-9270-a32412d9566b","uuid":"c1a7f787-ecc6-4fd3-8ecc-7eeff95e69a5"}
