{"level":30,"time":1778188669860,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24V19JQH2BR9YHKEKB3YDS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed the site plan review for Grouping 1 (Site Feature Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines) for the Valley View Townhomes project. \n\n## Summary of Findings\n\n**Review Scope:** Valley View Townhomes - 39-unit multi-family residential development, 3759 Valley View Road, Austin, TX. Overhead electric (OHE) lines confirmed on site plan along southern property boundary adjacent to utility poles in 5' electric easement.\n\n**Key Deficiencies Identified:**\n\n**FAIL Items (6):**\n1. **EL-1.7** - Surveyed conductor elevations not on building elevation sheets\n2. **EL-1.8** - Clearance dimension annotations absent from plans and sections  \n3. **EL-1.14** - Retaining walls near OHE lack clearance dimensions\n4. **EL-1.17** - Retaining wall sections lack clearance dimensions from conductor\n5. **EL-1.31** - No registered surveyor data for vertical clearance verification\n6. **EL-1.37** - Non-utility-compatible trees (Live Oak) proposed near overhead lines\n\n**NOT-VERIFIABLE Items (32):**\nClearance dimensions, surveyed conductor elevations, and conflict analyses are missing for: buildings (EL-1.1, 1.2, 1.3, 1.6), building projections (EL-1.3), elevated features (EL-1.5), fences and fence posts (EL-1.9, 1.10, 1.13), transmission fencing (EL-1.12), driveway vertical clearances (EL-1.18), parking clearances (EL-1.19), pole conflicts (EL-1.22), streetlights (EL-1.24), sidewalks (EL-1.25), trash areas (EL-1.26), facilities in easements (EL-1.27), water meters and lines (EL-1.28, 1.29), line crossings (EL-1.32), decorative lighting (EL-1.36), guy wires (EL-1.40, 1.41, 1.42), transformers (EL-1.43), construction staging (EL-1.45), streetlight adjacency (EL-1.39), meter obstructions (EL-1.38), and service-mast clearances (EL-1.47).\n\n**PASS Items (1):**\n- **EL-1.46** - 48-hour Austin Energy notification requirement properly documented on Sheet 3\n\n**N/A Items:**\nGas pump canopies (EL-1.4), transmission secondary/primary crossings (EL-1.33), marquee signs (EL-1.34), underground service poles (EL-1.35), transformer niches (EL-1.44)\n\n**Critical Documentation Gaps:**\n- No building elevation sheets with conductor surveys\n- No clearance dimension annotations anywhere on plans\n- No vertical profile/section views showing OHE relationships\n- Trees proposed in landscape plan are not species-identified on individual sheets; plant list contains non-compliant species for OHE proximity\n\nThe structured findings have been submitted with detailed evidence and reasoning for each item evaluated."}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"542f56f3-727d-4ed6-b349-d11f7598fb66","uuid":"11648790-1d3e-413a-9da6-b9ddbb07d687"}
