{"level":30,"time":1778188679004,"pid":122,"hostname":"e70bc6df-98e","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR24VMRNH0DTX1D0GNPEB633","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I've successfully evaluated all 15 checklist items and provided the structured output. Let me review what I found:\n\n**FAIL (2 items):**\n1. EL-2.3 - Large trees (40+ feet) within 25 feet of distribution line\n2. EL-2.15 - Trees in prohibited zones without Austin Energy approval\n\n**NOT-VERIFIABLE (3 items):**\n1. EL-2.1 - Non-utility-compatible trees within 15 feet (UC designation not verifiable from documents)\n2. EL-2.6 - Trees within 10 feet of poles (exact distances not dimensioned)\n3. EL-2.11 - Large trees not differentiated on plans (no explicit large tree notation)\n\n**N/A (5 items):**\n- EL-2.2 (no transmission lines)\n- EL-2.4 (no transmission lines)\n- EL-2.5 (no transmission easement)\n- EL-2.7 (no pad-mounted equipment near trees)\n- EL-2.8 (no underground equipment near trees)\n- EL-2.9 (no trees within 20 feet of underground equipment)\n\n**PASS (5 items):**\n- EL-2.10 (plant legend identifies species)\n- EL-2.12 (no incorrect measurement methodology)\n- EL-2.13 (no incorrect canopy-referenced measurements)\n- EL-2.14 (trees shown on landscape plan relative to utilities)\n\nThis is a solid set of findings. The main issue is that large native trees (Live Oak and Cedar Elm) are being planted just 3-5 feet from an overhead electric line running along the property boundary, with no documented clearance verification or Austin Energy approval. This violates both the large tree restriction (EL-2.3) and the general requirement for Austin Energy approval (EL-2.15).\n\n\nThe output has been submitted successfully.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8e2cb63b-05d8-41aa-bedd-77a52405a611","uuid":"7eca1575-50c0-4412-b05d-c19ab1439416"}
